What this licence covers: the source code, the patch sets (`src/patchsets/`),
the installer, the shaders, the tools and the documentation written for this
project. The cnc-ddraw patches in `third_party/cnc-ddraw/` are offered under
cnc-ddraw's own MIT licence (see that folder).

What it does NOT cover: War Wind itself. The game's art, music, sound, video
and text are the property of their rights holders (DreamForge Intertainment /
SSI and successors) and cannot be licensed here. Everything derived from them,
that is `assets/backdrop.png`, the AI-upscaled cutscenes distributed with the
releases, the screenshots of the original game in `docs/images/` and the
banner, stays subject to those rights. They are provided only for use with a
legitimately owned copy of the game, and no licence to them is granted or
implied by this file. Third-party components keep their own licences (see
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt in the releases).
